      "created_at": "2015-07-09T18:49:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<blockquote>\n<p>The Ennead instructions card does not count as a villain card or as a card in play. It is nothing, but does things.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I’m not sure it matters for many situations, but is that statement also true for other villain instructions cards, the Sentinels instructions card, the various special things in Kaargra Warfang’s deck, and so on?</p>",
