      "created_at": "2015-07-12T22:29:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>https://greaterthangames.com/comment/58413#comment-58413</p><p>The last 3 posts on that page clarify that the Sentinels Set-up card is an in play card.</p><p>I had always assumed the Ennead set-up card was a villain card in play, like other set-up cards. Why is there a specific ruling for this one, if I may?&nbsp;</p>",
