      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Because if it is, there are weird interactions. Can Cedistic Dissonant destroy it? If it&#39;s a character card, does it deal damage? How does that even make sense?</p><p>We asked Christopher, and he said what is written there.</p><p>Most villain instructions cards do not exist in the digital version. They are just part of the main character card. But the Ennead don&#39;t have one, and that instructions card needs to be there for the player to read, so it must exist in some way in the UI.</p>",
